cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Adaptive Sensor Weighting for Tactical Spatial Attribution (Section 3.3 reference implementation)"
abstract: >-
  Single-file C++17 reference implementation of Section 3.3 (Adaptive Sensor
  Weighting) of a dissertation on hybrid Bayesian tactical spatial
  identification of Wi-Fi signal sources: product-form normalized weight,
  four canonical quality components, trust-domain caps, rate limiter,
  hysteresis, emergency exclusion, weight trace and reason codes.
type: software
